    tldr: "InnoPharmax is a Taiwanese pharmaceutical company running phase 3 trials of D07001, its oral formulation of the chemotherapy irinotecan, in biliary tract cancer.",
    summary: "InnoPharmax, based in Taipei, develops oral formulations of established cancer drugs. Its lead programme D07001 is an oral form of irinotecan designed to allow outpatient dosing, in phase 3 trials for advanced biliary tract cancer after first-line chemotherapy. Sponsor and trial facts are from the ClinicalTrials.gov registry.",
